data_NOENT
# Synthetic: a depositor-made file without _entity. Its own _chem_comp calls
# NAG a non-polymer (so the lists sort it) and gives QQQ an unknown type
# (flagged). MSE with a label_seq_id is in the chain; the free MSE is not and,
# with no SEQRES to name it, is an ordinary ligand. BGC is not in _chem_comp,
# so the CCD table makes it a sugar (branched).
_entry.id NOENT
#
loop_
_chem_comp.id
_chem_comp.type
_chem_comp.name
ALA 'L-peptide linking' ALANINE
MSE 'L-peptide linking' SELENOMETHIONINE
NAG non-polymer 'N-ACETYL-D-GLUCOSAMINE'
QQQ 'mystery linking' 'UNKNOWN KIND'
#
